description: 'Trigger ONLY when the user requests recommending AppSec (CAS/ASPM) policies
  and creating the approved report or block policy (guardrail) against source code
  assets, including AI-recommended policy suggestions. Examples: "create a policy
  that blocks critical KEV vulnerabilities", "suggest policies for my repos", "add
  a guardrail for secrets with a fix". Do not activate for policy exceptions or overrides,
  custom rule authoring, or cloud posture policy creation.'
